<ol>
<li>
<p>Pour tap water into the bottle.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Activate it, turning water into aqueous ozone, a powerful disinfectant.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Use it to disinfect surfaces around your house using just tap water!</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Wake up one morning eager to clean.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Spray the kitchen counter.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Notice that the counter seems to give way under the spray.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Wipe the counter and see it continues to erode, as if it’s made of sand.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Examine the debris that has come away and realize that, in fact, it <em>is</em> sand.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Try to turn on the stovetop; the knob crumbles in your grip.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Try to open the fridge; the door collapses forward in a rush of sand.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Push on the nearest wall; it gives way into a pile of sand, and the floor begins to rumble. Oh god! What have you done? This place is going to cave in entirely!</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Locate the voice calling, “Quick! Down here!” It’s coming from a hole in the floor.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Leap into the hole just as the room collapses around you.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Meet the person who called you: Rodrigo.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Crawl through the corridors behind him.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>In a dark, carved-out space, meet the others: Ellie, Mort, Helen, and Thalia.</p>
</li>
<li>
