<li>
<p>Agree to join their rescue team.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Rescue several more survivors with them.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Grow tired of playing defense.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Rally the assembled survivors into a revolutionary force; together, you will not only escape, but entrap the Sandman in his own horrible arena.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Locate the entry hatch where the Sandman and his goons bring in the sleeping prisoners.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Dig a tunnel and scoop out a chamber right next to it, leaving a thin wall of sand so the Sandman does not know it’s there.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Wait until he drops off the next prisoner.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>When you hear the hatch open, burst through.</p>
</li>
<li>
